clink-completions 0.6.9: the unmodified "Source code (zip)" of the release
https://github.com/vladimir-kotikov/clink-completions/releases/tag/v0.6.9

Licensed under MIT (vendor/clink-completions/LICENSE).

build.bat copies it to build\clink-completions; the server puts that folder on each tab's
CLINK_PATH. To upgrade, replace vendor/clink-completions with a newer release's source zip
and update this file.
